  "title": "Sorry, I can't come",
  "goal": "Say what you can't do in any tense with -(y)AmA: gelemem, bulamadım, duyamıyorum.",
  "points": ["gp-ama-inability", "gp-abil"],
  "intro": {
    "text": "**Can't** is `-(y)AmA`, followed by any tense: *gelemiyorum* (I can't come), *gelemedim* (I couldn't come), *gelemem* (I can't come), *gelemeyeceğim* (I won't be able to come). There's no *bil* in it: *gelebilirim*, but *gelemem*.",
    "see": "gp-ama-inability"
  },
